# Node modules (will be installed during build)
**/node_modules

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/.next
**/build

# Git
**/.git
**/.github

# IDE
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.kiro

# Agent directories (contain symlinks that cause issues)
**/.agent
**/.agents

# Environment files
**/.env*
!**/.env.production

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log
**/yarn-debug.log
**/yarn-error.log
**/lerna-debug.log

# Lock files - KEEP package-lock.json for ariad
**/yarn.lock

# Test coverage
**/coverage

# Temporary files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/tmp
**/.tmp

# Documentation
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/*.md
!**/SKILL.md
!**/AGENTS.md
